    code: pageScript,
    note: 'Just <code class="font-mono text-sm">_parallaxScroller</code>. <code class="font-mono text-sm">resize</code> sets the range to while the text is pinned. <code class="font-mono text-sm">animate()</code> runs three keyframes on each letter over its own part of it, dim, pop and its own color, a step apart, so about 5 letters move at once. A smaller <code class="font-mono text-sm">_step</code> moves more of them, like a wave of words. The bold is a text-shadow in the same color, so any font works and the line stays put.'
